1
00:00:00,204 --> 00:00:03,334
WOMAN: Where are you going?
MAN: Just gonna take a look around outside.

2
00:00:03,499 --> 00:00:05,839
(Sheldon:)Bad idea.

3
00:00:07,795 --> 00:00:09,795
WOMAN:
No, Jim, don't open the door.

4
00:00:09,964 --> 00:00:12,424
(Sheldon:)Listen to her, Jim.

5
00:00:13,884 --> 00:00:15,174
[DOOR CREAKS ON VIDEO]

6
00:00:15,344 --> 00:00:17,094
MAN:
Don't worry. There's no one out there.

7
00:00:17,263 --> 00:00:19,553
[SCARY MUSIC PLAYS AND
WOMAN SCREAMS ON VIDEO]

8
00:00:27,273 --> 00:00:28,313
[KNOCKING]

9
00:00:28,482 --> 00:00:31,822
SHELDON: Leonard and Penny.
Leonard and Penny. Leonard and Penny.

10
00:00:32,737 --> 00:00:35,277
LEONARD:
Who is it?

11
00:00:39,285 --> 00:00:43,205
All right. We've got a titanium deadbolt
and a reinforced jam controlled by...

12
00:00:43,372 --> 00:00:45,962
(Howard:)...a state-of-the-art
electronic access system.

13
00:00:46,125 --> 00:00:48,505
(Sheldon:)-What if they cut the power?
-There's a 200-watt...

14
00:00:48,669 --> 00:00:51,959
(Raj:)-...uninterruptible backup power supply.
-If someone steals my keys?

15
00:00:52,131 --> 00:00:54,721
(Raj:)There are independent voice
and fingerprint scanners.

16
00:00:54,884 --> 00:00:57,134
What if somebody kidnaps me,
records my voice...

17
00:00:57,303 --> 00:01:00,023
(Sheldon:)...and then cuts off my thumb?

